OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's Hunterian Art Gallery
OL,4,Abecomes A-listed protected building
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hunterian Art Gallery and
OL,7,FMackintosh House in Glasgow have been
OL,8,Fadded to Scotland's list of protected
OL,9,Fhistoric places.
OL,11,FHistoric Environment Scotland (HES)
OL,12,Fmade the decision after a public
OL,13,Fconsultation earlier this year, with
OL,14,Fthe venue now becoming a category
OL,15,FA-listed building.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
