OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's Hunterian Art Gallery
OL,4,Abecomes A-listed protected building
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building was designed by William
OL,7,FWhitfield and built between 1973 and
OL,8,F1978 for the University of Glasgow. It
OL,9,Fhouses the university's art collection
OL,10,Fand partially reassembled interiors
OL,11,Ffrom Charles Rennie Mackintosh's and
OL,12,FMargaret Macdonald's former home.
OL,14,FHES said the art gallery represented an
OL,15,F"outstanding example of a late
OL,16,Fmodernist cultural building" and
OL,17,Fpraised it for reconstructing
OL,18,FMackintosh's house.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
